flowchart TD
    Start([Start: User Access TeleMed Platform]) --> AuthCheck{Authenticated?}
    
    AuthCheck -- No --> Login[User Log In / Registration]
    Login --> JWT[Issue Signed JWT Token & Role]
    JWT --> DashboardSelect
    
    AuthCheck -- Yes --> DashboardSelect{User Role?}
    
    DashboardSelect -- Patient --> PatientFlow[Patient Portal Dashboard]
    DashboardSelect -- Doctor --> DoctorFlow[Doctor Portal Workspace]
    DashboardSelect -- Admin --> AdminFlow[Admin Governance Dashboard]

    %% Patient Subflow
    PatientFlow --> SelectIntake[Select New Health Assessment]
    SelectIntake --> UploadInput[Upload / Input Biomarkers]
    UploadInput --> ValidateData[Intake Schema Validation & Quality Check]
    
    ValidateData -- Invalid --> IntakeError[Display Data Error & Prompt Correction]
    IntakeError --> UploadInput
    
    ValidateData -- Valid --> Preprocess[Feature Normalization & Preprocessing]
    Preprocess --> ModalityDetect[Detect Active Modalities: Clinical, Wearable, Gut]
    
    ModalityDetect --> RunExperts[Execute Applicable Single-Modality Experts]
    RunExperts --> FusionStacking[V4 Stacking Fusion Engine & Calibrator]
    FusionStacking --> GenPredictions[Generate 5 Disease Probability Scores]
    
    GenPredictions --> PersistRecord[(Persist Health Record & Prediction Snapshot in PostgreSQL)]
    PersistRecord --> TreeSHAP[Trigger XAI TreeSHAP Feature Attribution]
    TreeSHAP --> RAGReport[Trigger Medical RAG Evidence Retrieval & Synthesis]
    
    RAGReport --> DisplayResults[Display Dashboard, Risk Scores, XAI Plots & Report]
    DisplayResults --> OptPDF{Download PDF?}
    OptPDF -- Yes --> GeneratePDF[ReportLab Engine Generates PDF Download]
    OptPDF -- No --> HistoryView[Save to Patient Health History]

    %% Doctor Subflow
    DoctorFlow --> ReviewQueue[Review Consultation Requests & Patient Queue]
    ReviewQueue --> OpenRecord[Inspect Patient Record, Predictions & XAI]
    OpenRecord --> AddNote[Add Clinical Notes & Follow-up Guidance]
    AddNote --> DoctorEnd([Complete Patient Consultation Review])

    %% Admin Subflow
    AdminFlow --> VerifyDocs[Verify Pending Doctor Registrations]
    VerifyDocs --> AuditLogs[Inspect Immutable Security Audit Logs]
    AuditLogs --> AdminEnd([Complete Governance Audit])

    GeneratePDF --> HistoryView
    HistoryView --> PatientEnd([End Assessment Flow])
